  "2026-10-21T11:55:08.372Z","harness:codex","Live October21 intake: all five minor tooling candidates remain younger than seven days (eslint10.13.0 October16, gpt-tokenizer4.1.0 and greptile3.7.0 October18, knip6.42.1 and typescript-eslint8.72.0 October19). Registry timestamps were refreshed; no cooldown bypass. pnpm audit has zero advisories at all severities, and GitHub has zero open dependency PRs or dependency/code/secret-scanning alerts. Existing Sentry11, Vitest5/CodSpeed6, npm-package-arg14 and TypeScript7 owners remain the canonical migration work; this item stays open and unclaimed."
  "2026-10-21T16:39:21.039Z","harness:codex","October21 16:38UTC live registry refresh: new jscpd5.4.2 published October20T16:14:40Z joins the existing cooldown queue. eslint10.13.0 October16T14:24:10Z, gpt-tokenizer4.1.0 October18T05:43:37Z, greptile3.7.0 October18T00:02:04Z, knip6.42.1 October19T18:24:59Z and typescript-eslint8.72.0 October19T17:08:09Z remain within seven-day cooldown. No open dependency PRs or security alerts. Preserve canonical major-migration owners and keep this queued owner open/unclaimed."
  "2026-10-21T18:58:45.759Z","harness:codex","PR1536 full-review correction: acceptance criteria now include both jscpd5.4.2 and typescript-eslint8.72.0, matching the six-package cooldown census already recorded in comments. Existing strict static, token, review-tool and coverage gates remain required. This is a tracking correction, not adoption of these still-ineligible upgrades; release to open/unclaimed immediately afterward."
  "2026-10-21T22:42:36.857Z","harness:codex","Fresh October22 local / October21 UTC registry census: jscpd5.4.2 age1d, eslint10.13.0 age5d, gpt-tokenizer4.1.0 age3d, greptile3.7.0 age3d, knip6.42.1 age2d and typescript-eslint8.72.0 age2d remain below the unchanged seven-day adoption minimum. Full locked advisory gate passes across568 packages and GitHub reports zero open dependency PRs or alerts. Preserve this canonical owner open/unclaimed; no cooldown bypass. Major owners remain pm-fokyhh, pm-t3jxjj, pm-do5b and pm-ksr40d; npm-package-arg14 requires Node22.22.2 versus the supported22.18.0 floor."
